#. Description of the plugin
#: power-custom-post-order.php
msgid "Drag-and-drop custom post ordering for any post type and WooCommerce products, with per-taxonomy ordering, order variations (manual, alphabetical, price, popularity, random, etc.), sticky posts, hidden posts, order templates, CSV import/export, per-role ordering, REST API, and shortcode/template tag for manual queries. Works with every theme and Elementor."
msgstr ""

